# The cloud-init provisioning script is shipped to Azure byte-for-byte via filebase64().
# A Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows installer default) would
# rewrite it to CRLF, the shebang would become "#!/bin/bash\r", and every student's VM
# would boot with no toolchain. Force LF regardless of the cloning machine's settings.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Terraform and its inputs are read by tooling, not by Windows editors. Keep them LF too.
*.tf text eol=lf
*.tfvars text eol=lf
*.tfvars.json text eol=lf
